# Intermediate Teamwork (sandoria 64) with its era module (quest rework B3b, Task 9): five Elvaan (main, carl and eve
# male, bob and dave female) and a Tarutaru male (fay). The module (xi.pre(xi.expansion.ROV): RESTRICT_CONTENT 1,
# ENABLE_ROV 0) counts the members of the race of the char who talks; Elvaan and Tarutaru are not of a kind.
# Introduction completed and Intermediate accepted by GM, for main and fay. main (Elvaan) talks: #party 6, five
# Elvaan, updateEvent(4, 2) (the quest's own: 15, 2); then fay (the Tarutaru) talks: one, updateEvent(4, 2);
# finish option 0 each: nothing.
module modules/era/lua/quests/sandoria/intermediate_teamwork.lua
lists WestRonfaure/Vilatroire/onTrigger WestRonfaure/onEventUpdate/129 WestRonfaure/onEventFinish/129
char zone=WestRonfaure pos=-258.861,-70.999,423.42 job=WAR race=3 lvl=10
char bob zone=WestRonfaure pos=-258.861,-70.999,428 job=WAR race=4 lvl=10
char carl zone=WestRonfaure pos=-256,-70.999,426 job=WAR race=3 lvl=10
char dave zone=WestRonfaure pos=-256,-70.999,421 job=WAR race=4 lvl=10
char eve zone=WestRonfaure pos=-261.5,-70.999,426 job=WAR race=3 lvl=10
char fay zone=WestRonfaure pos=-261.5,-70.999,421 job=WAR race=5 lvl=10
setting RESTRICT_CONTENT 1
setting ENABLE_ROV 0
quest Sandoria.IntroductionToTeamwork completed
quest Sandoria.IntermediateTeamwork accepted
fay: quest Sandoria.IntroductionToTeamwork completed
fay: quest Sandoria.IntermediateTeamwork accepted
login
bob: login
carl: login
dave: login
eve: login
fay: login
invite bob
bob: accept
invite carl
carl: accept
invite dave
dave: accept
invite eve
eve: accept
invite fay
fay: accept                    # five Elvaan and a Tarutaru
trigger Vilatroire                       # 129 { [1] = 2 }
update 129 option=0                      # main an Elvaan: five of the kind (not 6): updateEvent(4, 2)
finish                                   # option 0, the local Prog 0: nothing
fay: trigger Vilatroire                  # 129 { [1] = 2 }
fay: update 129 option=0                 # fay a Tarutaru: one of the kind: updateEvent(4, 2)
fay: finish                              # option 0, the local Prog 0: nothing